      "mergeID": "626a08ef291bc21a450c562b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When I save text in the \"Tell us a a bit about yourself\" section of my profile (on the VRChat website) and click \"OK,\" the text switches to all lowercase, the spaces between words are removed and it doesn't even preserve the correct characters, behaving as though poor OCR has been applied to an image of text. For instance, I will see \"rn,\" instead of \"m.\" It's very strange. I tried logging in and out. I also tried it in both Chrome and Firefox, with the same problem.",
