      "mergedPostDetails": "Description: The profile text becomes weird automatically.\nRepro Steps:\n1. Press your profile text area.\n2. Type or paste this message accurately.\n\"My microphone has been broken.\nI do not understand English.\nIt seems like I won't be able to play.\"\n3. Press its Ok button.\nExpected: I get the same text.\n\"My microphone has been broken.\nI do not understand English.\nIt seems like I won't be able to play.\"\nActual: I get this weird text.\n\"mymicrophonehasbeenbrokenidonotunderstandenglipoopseemslikeiwontbeabletoplay\"\nMy browser is Firefox Browser 97.0.1\n____\n\nI think this reporting system is also weird.\nIt inserts unnecessary empty lines and changes the number 3 to 1.\nYou must see the images I uploaded to understand the repro steps correctly.",
