      "value": "Thanks for speaking up! Like @{60c0e22718009c104862d5bc|full_name} said, it's more helpful if each Canny request focuses on a specific issue. Otherwise, user votes would become less useful.\n\n@{5a4b034d1ab4366d42644996|full_name} - The text you posted contains the character \"TURNED DIGIT THREE\", Unciode character U+218B.\n\nIt's a duodecimal digit in math. I think unusual Unicode characters are often filtered for security reasons, or because it would be too difficult for VRChat to support every Unicode character.",
